1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,920
XIANZHUANG

4
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,000
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

5
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:53,960
Lady Shou'an, she's here.

6
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:02,280
Child, come closer.
Let me have a good look at you.

7
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,200
Go on!

8
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,560
Mind your manners!

9
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:10,000
I told you again and again

10
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,880
to bring her here nicely

11
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,000
and do not frighten her!

12
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:19,080
Lady Shou'an,
you had me seized at midnight.

13
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,120
What do you want from me?

14
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:27,240
What a lovely young woman.

15
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,360
Beautiful and poised.

16
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:33,160
You are even more like
my granddaughter than Rao.

17
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,600
But, child,

18
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:38,640
you're always on guard, always wary.

19
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:41,560
It shows
how frightened and uneasy you are.

20
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:45,440
Do you really want to spend
the rest of your life

21
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:48,400
walking on eggshells like this?

22
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,920
I asked you here today

23
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,640
because I want to make you a deal.

24
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,640
What kind of deal?

25
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,680
You took a place that wasn't yours.

26
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:04,560
How can you ever live in peace?

27
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:07,600
If you're willing to step aside,

28
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:10,080
the Zhou family will compensate you.

29
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,360
Everyone knows

30
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:14,760
my eldest daughter
married into the Huo family in Jiangnan.

31
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:19,160
Although the Huo family
isn't as powerful as the Lu family,

32
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:23,160
they still live in luxury
and possess a vast fortune.

33
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,280
Huo Jue.

34
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:29,360
Grandmother.

35
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:33,680
The Huo family is open-minded.

36
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:35,520
they don't ask about birth or rank.

37
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:38,440
They only want a smart, capable woman

38
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,400
who can handle great responsibility.

39
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:42,440
From now on, she will follow you

40
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:44,280
and do business across the country.

41
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:47,440
The perfect woman is right here.
What do you think?

42
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,600
I wouldn't dare go against your wishes.

43
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,600
I shall abide entirely by
Grandmother's decision.

44
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,240
You heard him.

45
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:57,360
Once you become Huo Jue's wife,

46
00:03:57,440 --> 00:04:00,280
your enemies will become your family.

47
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:05,040
You won't have to fear being silencedñ
or losing your life.

48
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:08,000
As for the Lu family, I have my ways.

49
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:11,000
Once you two secretly switch places,

50
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:14,320
I'll keep Jundai out of sight.

51
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:19,000
As time passes,
no one will question you anymore.

52
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:22,200
Then this will all be behind us.

53
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,400
What are you laughing at?

54
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:32,360
Grandmother is even offering marriage
to put your mind at ease.

55
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,360
Lu Zhuo may come from a powerful family,

56
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,720
but the higher the stakes,
the colder his heart.

57
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,760
If he ever learns the truth,

58
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:40,920
he'll feel utterly humiliated.

59
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:44,200
He'll be the first one to kill you.

60
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,920
The Huo family trades far and wide.

61
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,560
Keeping our word matters above all.

62
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:52,840
I've personally agreed to this marriage.
I'll treat you well from now on.

63
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:57,040
Come south with me and leave the capital.
No one there will know your past.

64
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,960
You'll be free, wealthy, and safe.

65
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:02,280
Better than living on the edge, isn't it?

66
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:10,360
If you insist on being stubborn,
no one can save you.

67
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:14,200
Thank you for your kindness, Lady Shou'an.

68
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,720
How merciful of you to spare my life.

69
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:22,080
As for marrying into the Huo family,
I'm not worthy of such an honor.

70
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:24,040
You insolent servant!

71
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:26,880
I'm the Huo family's eldest son.
You think I'm not good enough for you?

72
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:29,120
Huo Jue, mind your manners.

73
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:33,360
A lowborn woman may become a noble wife,

74
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:36,280
then die of a sudden illness at home,

75
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,960
or die giving birth,

76
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:41,560
or accidentally drown,

77
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:43,600
or fall from a horse and break her neck.

78
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:46,800
There are many ways to make
a death look natural.

79
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,320
Once I leave the capital,

80
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:50,920
wouldn't my life be entirely
in my husband's hands?

81
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:53,240
Who would seek justice
for a woman all alone?

82
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:55,800
Lady Shou'an's offer

83
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:58,800
only trades an immediate death
for a delayed one.

84
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,920
One means dying now.

85
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,560
The other means dying next fall.

86
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:05,960
Threats didn't work,
so now you're tempting me with rewards.

87
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,760
You even used your own grandson as bait.

88
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,000
Lady Shou'an, you certainly bet big.

89
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:14,520
You! You think too poorly of us!

90
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,600
Who's trying to hurt you?

91
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:20,080
Mother, I told you long ago.

92
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:23,560
This woman is greedy, cunning,
and impossible to reason with.

93
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:26,760
- Why waste your breath on her?
- Aunt.

94
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:29,520
Mother, you're far too softhearted.

95
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:32,080
Let me handle this.

96
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:47,080
Who in the world would've imagined

97
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:49,040
a lowly night-soil woman

98
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:51,880
would dare impersonate my daughter?

99
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:55,520
Such outrageous nerve!

100
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:59,080
A-Chou, I'll give you one last chance.

101
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:03,600
Kneel, beg forgiveness,
and repent for what you've done.

102
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,640
Then I'll spare your life.

103
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:08,000
Did you hear me?

104
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,440
Kneel before Lady Li
and admit your wrongs!

105
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:11,320
Wrongs?

106
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,920
Your daughter was the one

107
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:17,800
who made me take her place
and tried to kill me time and again.

108
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:20,200
What did I do wrong?

109
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:25,440
The high and low
have always had their proper place.

110
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:28,640
You're nothing but a drab little sparrow,

111
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:33,240
yet you keep trying
to force your way into a phoenix's nest.

112
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:36,400
You've schemed and stopped at nothing.

113
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:41,360
You are simply too greedy.

114
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:45,000
Nothing could ever satisfy you.
That's why you've ended up here.

115
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:48,240
Yet you still dare claim
you've done nothing wrong.

116
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:51,160
If I say you're wrong, then you're wrong.

117
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,280
Don't you dare talk back to me again!

118
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:58,080
How ridiculous.

119
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:01,560
Wasn't Lady Li a wet nurse's daughter too?

120
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,440
Slap her!

121
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,200
Aunt.

122
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,760
Don't lower yourself by arguing
with an ill-mannered lowborn girl.

123
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:17,000
I did nothing wrong.

124
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:20,160
Child, why put yourself through this?

125
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,200
Defying Lady Li is punishable by death!

126
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:25,200
Do you truly want to die? Apologize now!

127
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:27,000
What makes something right or wrong?

128
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:29,400
The world isn't that simple.

129
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:32,919
When it's cold and rainy,
you fear the silkworms will freeze.

130
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:36,200
When the sun shines bright,
you fear the crops will dry out.

131
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:39,960
Clouds harm the silkworms.

132
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:42,360
Sunshine can hurt the crops even more.

133
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,760
Even heaven
can't always please the farmers.

134
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,480
I'm only human.

135
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:50,360
I just want to survive.

136
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:52,520
I just want to live with dignity.

137
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:57,040
As long as I haven't broken the law
or killed anyone or set fires,

138
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:59,080
I've done nothing
that weighs on my conscience!

139
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:01,640
So what I've done,
what right do you have to call it wrong?

140
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,920
Silence! I said silence! Do you hear me?

141
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,000
No!

142
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:10,600
Should I grovel before you
and beg forgiveness?

143
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,600
Would you really spare my life then?

144
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:18,320
Since you wouldn't,
why should I humiliate myself?

145
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:20,360
In this life,

146
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:23,880
I've knelt and begged more than enough.

147
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,160
- You…
- Bring it in.

148
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,200
You have two choices.

149
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:54,160
Leave the capital with Huo Jue,

150
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,920
and never return
for the rest of your life.

151
00:09:57,520 --> 00:10:00,400
Or I'll have you boiled alive.

152
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,600
Then this ends with your death.

153
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:05,440
I won't pursue your crime
of posing as a noblewoman,

154
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:08,600
nor will I arrest or punish your family.

155
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,560
You decide.

156
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,680
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

157
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:20,720
Mother, you're still
in the mood to tend flowers?

158
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:23,400
The hibiscus you planted in the courtyard

159
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:26,160
was completely ruined
by those women in Father's study.

160
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,320
Really?

161
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,280
Mother!

162
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:35,280
Grandmother kept Father in line before,

163
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,520
so he didn't dare behave so shamelessly.

164
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,880
But since her eye trouble
left her confined indoors,

165
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:41,280
he's become even more muddleheaded.

166
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:45,760
Those flirtatious maids
in the courtyard were bad enough.

167
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:49,280
Last month, he even brought in
two singers through the side gate.

168
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:51,200
The whole household is in chaos.

169
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,480
Children shouldn't speak ill
of their father.

170
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:59,080
Your father's affairs
are no concern of yours.

171
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:03,840
Look. Two flowers blooming on one branch.

172
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:04,840
How lovely.

173
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:08,120
There.

174
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:10,400
I'll put it right here.

175
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:13,720
Mother never seems to care
about anything concerning Father.

176
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:15,680
I truly don't understand.

177
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:19,040
But you seem so happy today, Mother.

178
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,720
Is there some good news?

179
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:24,040
The best news ever.

180
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:38,920
Lu Zhuo.

181
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,360
I was just coming to find you!

182
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,720
Something happened. Wei Rao…

183
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:42,640
I know.

184
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:45,040
Wait for me.

185
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,680
I thought you had more nerve than this.

186
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:00,880
Turns out you're nothing special.

187
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:05,800
I hear your real father
was a shameless gambler.

188
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:07,440
Like father, like daughter.

189
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:09,400
Dragons breed dragons,
phoenixes breed phoenixes.

190
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,240
Eagles soar, while rats burrow.

191
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:15,520
Fine clothes and precious jewels

192
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:18,320
can't hide the greed in your blood.

193
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,960
It's already dawn.

194
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:24,880
What are you still stalling for?

195
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:27,920
Admit your guilt and surrender.
I'll spare your life.

196
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,400
My aunt always keeps her word.

197
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:39,280
No one in this house dares defy her.
Bow your head and confess!

198
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:43,240
Don't you value your life above all?

199
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:45,520
Even if you only delay
your death till fall,

200
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,800
at least you'll survive today.

201
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:49,320
I only wanted to see

202
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:52,280
how far a little sparrow like me
could go, how high I could fly.

203
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:54,720
Too bad I'll never get the chance.

204
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,680
I've done nothing wrong.

205
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:59,960
Kill me however you please.

206
00:13:00,640 --> 00:13:02,960
What a stubborn girl.

207
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:05,320
Even now, you still refuse to give up.

208
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:09,800
Or do you really think I won't kill you?

209
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,600
Then boil me alive.

210
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:18,560
A-Chou!

211
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,440
Lady Li, Lord Lu is here.

212
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:29,720
Perfect timing.

213
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:33,880
He came here himself.
That saves me a great deal of trouble.

214
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:39,160
Let's see whether the Lu family
really dares oppose me openly.

215
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:41,400
Make her see sense!

216
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:47,280
What are you doing? Let me go! Let me go!

217
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:49,160
What are you doing?

218
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:08,600
Lu Zhuo greets Your Ladyship.

219
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:11,000
You seem to be in quite a hurry, Lord Lu.

220
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,360
Where are you rushing off to?

221
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:15,520
I heard Your Ladyship
invited Wei Rao here for a visit.

222
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,560
I shouldn't have disturbed you,

223
00:14:16,640 --> 00:14:19,320
but she's Grandmother's
favorite granddaughter-in-law.

224
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:23,520
Grandmother kept asking after her,
so I came to take her home.

225
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:26,400
I invited my own daughter here
for a reunion.

226
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:27,640
What's the rush?

227
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:32,360
You really are newlyweds,
so deeply devoted

228
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:34,360
you can't bear
to be apart for even a moment.

229
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:37,080
Rao, come here.

230
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:39,440
Your husband is here to take you home.

231
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:16,280
Your Ladyship,
what is the meaning of this?

232
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:24,520
My late husband and I
were once deeply in love.

233
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:27,880
We thought we'd grow old together.

234
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:30,200
But fate had other plans.

235
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:33,120
A great battle broke out
beyond Qiyang Pass.

236
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,280
I lost my husband.

237
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:37,600
Rao lost the father who loved her most.

238
00:15:38,280 --> 00:15:40,360
My husband died saving your father.

239
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,440
So the old duke made a vow.

240
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:45,960
One day, his heir would marry Rao

241
00:15:47,040 --> 00:15:49,480
to make up for her
losing her father so young

242
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:52,440
and repay what the Lu family
owed the Wei family.

243
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:56,880
We both know exactly
who's inside that room.

244
00:15:58,800 --> 00:15:59,880
Lu Zhuo.

245
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:03,560
My husband and I
had only this one daughter.

246
00:16:04,280 --> 00:16:05,800
She was the treasure of our lives.

247
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:09,960
And now,
I'm placing her in your hands myself.

248
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:11,880
Treat her well.

249
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:14,040
I used to be spoiled and willful.

250
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:16,120
My foolishness caused many trouble.

251
00:16:17,040 --> 00:16:19,120
Mother gave me a stern lesson last night.

252
00:16:19,720 --> 00:16:21,120
I deeply regret what I've done.

253
00:16:22,680 --> 00:16:23,720
From now on,

254
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:26,080
I'll control my temper

255
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:28,560
and be a proper, virtuous principal wife.

256
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:32,160
My Lord, you're generous and forgiving.

257
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:35,960
Please let go of the past and forgive me.

258
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:46,080
Even pure gold has flaws.
So does fine jade.

259
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:47,640
No one is perfect.

260
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:49,600
Rao grew up without proper guidance.

261
00:16:49,680 --> 00:16:51,920
So naturally, she became somewhat spoiled.

262
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:54,080
From now on, I'll keep people by her side

263
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:56,160
to guide and correct her at all times.

264
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:58,560
She won't cause trouble again.

265
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:00,760
She'll become a proper principal wife.

266
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:04,599
The past is gone.
What matters is what comes next.

267
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:06,680
Now take your wife home.

268
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,880
Live in harmony from now on.

269
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:11,520
You can still make a fine couple.

270
00:17:33,120 --> 00:17:34,320
My Lord.

271
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:36,320
Lu Zhuo.

272
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:39,000
I know you're a man of honor
who keeps his word.

273
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:42,600
You would never break your promise
or cast aside what is right.

274
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:44,840
Isn't that so?

275
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:47,800
My Lu family kept the promise
and came for the bride.

276
00:17:49,520 --> 00:17:52,080
But did the Wei family keep yours?

277
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,880
You broke faith first.

278
00:17:55,560 --> 00:17:57,240
You refused to board the wedding carriage.

279
00:17:57,320 --> 00:18:00,120
So don't dream
of another chance in this life!

280
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,480
Lu Zhuo!

281
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,600
I used to be awful,

282
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:10,200
but only because my parents
weren't there to teach me.

283
00:18:10,280 --> 00:18:12,400
I never saw Father
from the time I could remember.

284
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:14,400
Mother couldn't stay by my side either.

285
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:16,080
Who was there to truly guide me?

286
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:18,560
I wasn't born this cruel.

287
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:21,360
You hate how vicious and overbearing
I am. I'll change.

288
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:23,840
I swear I'll turn over
a new leaf from this day on.

289
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:27,760
I'll never harm the innocent again.
I won't do anything you dislike again.

290
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:31,560
Lu Zhuo, I'm not ordering you.

291
00:18:32,120 --> 00:18:35,640
Just take this as a mother's plea.

292
00:18:40,360 --> 00:18:41,200
Lu Zhuo!

293
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:44,640
Mother, stop him!

294
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:47,600
- Stop him!
- Lu Zhuo, how dare you!

295
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,200
Stop!

296
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:55,160
Move!

297
00:18:58,280 --> 00:18:59,520
Careful.

298
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:13,120
Lord Lu! Lord Lu!

299
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:14,560
You can't take this woman!

300
00:19:15,560 --> 00:19:16,560
She's an impostor.

301
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:18,280
She's been deceiving everyone.

302
00:19:18,360 --> 00:19:19,560
Move.

303
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:22,160
You've seen the real Wei Rao
with your own eyes.

304
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:25,280
Your wife is standing
right in front of you,

305
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:26,320
yet you refuse to even look at her.

306
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,080
Instead, you're holding that woman.

307
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:29,840
Have you lost your mind?

308
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:32,640
When I was gravely ill and near death,

309
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:38,520
she came here in the wedding carriage
for the lucky marriage.

310
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:42,320
She married me
and joined me in honoring our ancestors.

311
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:45,040
She is my lawful wife.

312
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:48,760
As for anyone else,
they have nothing to do with me.

313
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:51,400
You heard him, Mother.

314
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:53,280
It's not that I refused to humble myself.

315
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:55,800
That temptress
has completely bewitched him.

316
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:57,800
He doesn't care for me at all.

317
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:59,560
I'm the noble daughter of an earl's house,

318
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:00,720
Lady Li's own daughter,

319
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:03,160
yet I'm worth less to him
than a lowly night-soil woman!

320
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:06,280
Mother, Lu Zhuo
has humiliated me like this,

321
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:08,960
and you still won't stand up for me?

322
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:11,040
I'll hang myself with a rope later!

323
00:20:11,120 --> 00:20:13,680
Better that than live in shame
for the rest of my life.

324
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:17,280
Lu Zhuo.

325
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:20,040
I tried to reason with you politely

326
00:20:20,800 --> 00:20:22,400
to preserve both families' dignity

327
00:20:23,360 --> 00:20:25,280
and protect your loyal family's good name.

328
00:20:25,800 --> 00:20:30,360
But if you truly anger me,
I'll take this before His Majesty.

329
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:32,600
Can the Lu family bear the consequences?

330
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:35,960
Lady Li, is that a threat?

331
00:20:36,560 --> 00:20:40,120
Call it a threat or a kind suggestion.

332
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:43,400
I don't care how powerful the Lu family is

333
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:45,720
or how many victories you've won, Lu Zhuo.

334
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:48,120
If you dare humiliate my daughter,

335
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:51,160
I'll make you pay a thousandfold.

336
00:20:52,040 --> 00:20:55,600
This woman is an impostor and a murderer.

337
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:58,280
Without my permission,
no one can take her away!

338
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:00,800
Quite the show of power, Lady Li.

339
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:04,320
The Lu family's title
was earned through real victories.

340
00:21:04,840 --> 00:21:07,560
Every honor we gained
was paid for in blood.

341
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:10,360
We won't be ruled
by a woman of the inner court.

342
00:21:11,560 --> 00:21:12,760
Zhao Song.

343
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:22,000
My wife, Lady Wei,
freed tenant farmers and aided refugees.

344
00:21:22,080 --> 00:21:24,360
She helps the poor and those in need.

345
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:26,720
Everyone in the capital praises her.

346
00:21:26,800 --> 00:21:28,320
A petition from the people
was presented to His Majesty.

347
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:29,960
His Majesty was greatly pleased.

348
00:21:31,600 --> 00:21:35,200
He issued a special decree
granting her the title of Noble Lady.

349
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:37,280
Her title is

350
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:39,720
Wu'an.

351
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:44,280
A Noble Lady?
His Majesty made her a Noble Lady?

352
00:21:45,080 --> 00:21:47,680
Impossible! A woman of such low birth

353
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:50,480
can't hold the same rank
as a prince's daughter!

354
00:21:50,560 --> 00:21:52,000
Lu Zhuo, you deserve death!

355
00:21:53,520 --> 00:21:54,400
For her,

356
00:21:55,040 --> 00:21:56,960
you actually petitioned
His Majesty for a title?

357
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:58,720
Now,

358
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:01,080
I'm here to take my wife,

359
00:22:04,280 --> 00:22:06,440
Noble Lady Wu'an, home.

360
00:22:09,640 --> 00:22:11,240
Who still dares stop me?

361
00:22:13,360 --> 00:22:14,560
Zhao Song, ready the horses!

362
00:22:16,720 --> 00:22:18,680
- You!
- Make way!

363
00:22:19,440 --> 00:22:21,640
No! She can't leave!

364
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:23,600
Mother, you promised to stand up for me!

365
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:26,640
Kill her for me!
Then Lu Zhuo must die too!

366
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:29,000
- Mother! Mother!
- Look at yourself!

367
00:22:29,080 --> 00:22:30,080
Take her away!

368
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:33,040
Mother! Mother!

369
00:22:33,120 --> 00:22:34,880
Mother!

370
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:36,840
Wretch!

371
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:47,120
- Were you burned?
- Grandmother.

372
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:49,080
I thought we could use
Aunt's authority today

373
00:22:49,720 --> 00:22:51,120
to force Lu Zhuo to take Jundai instead.

374
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:52,520
But he actually secured
a title for that woman.

375
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:54,800
What do we do now?

376
00:23:07,880 --> 00:23:08,840
Are you all right?

377
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:19,080
XIANZHUANG

378
00:23:25,360 --> 00:23:28,200
Easy. I won't let you fall.

379
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:30,680
Thank you.

380
00:23:33,480 --> 00:23:34,520
You worthless fool!

381
00:23:34,600 --> 00:23:37,320
After all I've done fighting for you,
you tossed me aside now!

382
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:38,760
Any conscience at all?

383
00:23:44,360 --> 00:23:45,760
Her Ladyship is back.

384
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:48,400
My Lord.

385
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:53,200
I have something to tell you.

386
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:57,040
If you didn't say it before,
then don't say it now.

387
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,320
Go back and tend to your wound.

388
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:21,640
It's fine. Don't worry.

389
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:25,000
After soaking it in cold water,
some medicine will take care of it.

390
00:24:25,840 --> 00:24:27,680
How did you get hurt this badly?

391
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:33,160
You…

392
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:34,760
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

393
00:24:34,840 --> 00:24:35,680
Wait.

394
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,400
I'll do it myself.

395
00:24:50,560 --> 00:24:51,800
Were you burned?

396
00:24:55,240 --> 00:24:58,040
Getting out safely
always comes at a price.

397
00:24:58,640 --> 00:25:00,760
That must hurt so much…

398
00:25:02,320 --> 00:25:03,680
It's nothing.

399
00:25:03,760 --> 00:25:06,400
Back when I worked for a living,
I suffered far worse injuries.

400
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:07,480
This is nothing.

401
00:25:08,480 --> 00:25:09,840
It doesn't hurt at all.

402
00:25:14,680 --> 00:25:16,680
It has to hurt. Don't pretend it doesn't.

403
00:25:16,760 --> 00:25:18,640
Look at you…

404
00:25:22,320 --> 00:25:24,640
- Fool.
- Let me see.

405
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:26,120
I'm really fine.

406
00:25:29,120 --> 00:25:30,840
Get out of here!

407
00:25:44,800 --> 00:25:47,240
- Master, spare me…
- Why are you crying?

408
00:25:48,360 --> 00:25:50,040
Stop those tears!

409
00:25:50,120 --> 00:25:52,360
Make a sound,

410
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:54,760
and I'll beat you to death.

411
00:26:02,080 --> 00:26:04,360
You worthless trash.

412
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:06,760
How dare you insult me?

413
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:09,440
Sooner or later, I'll tear you to pieces!

414
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:12,720
Rao.

415
00:26:16,560 --> 00:26:17,960
Clean this up.

416
00:26:31,040 --> 00:26:31,880
Mother.

417
00:26:35,800 --> 00:26:36,880
Leave us.

418
00:26:47,280 --> 00:26:48,120
Remember this.

419
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:51,240
No matter what happens,
never let your emotions show.

420
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:55,160
If servants see you lose your temper,
they'll see right through you.

421
00:26:55,760 --> 00:26:57,800
Who would truly fear a master

422
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:59,760
who's fierce outside but weak within?

423
00:26:59,840 --> 00:27:02,040
Especially those
who serve you day and night.

424
00:27:02,120 --> 00:27:04,200
You must treat them
even better from now on.

425
00:27:04,720 --> 00:27:06,400
Cruelty will only bring trouble later.

426
00:27:08,520 --> 00:27:09,360
Mother.

427
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:13,000
You know how badly I've been wronged.

428
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:16,520
I lost my temper. I know I was wrong.

429
00:27:18,120 --> 00:27:21,720
Now Grandmother despises me,
and the Lu family has cast me aside.

430
00:27:22,240 --> 00:27:23,520
If Father were still alive,

431
00:27:24,560 --> 00:27:26,760
someone would storm
the Lu Residence for me

432
00:27:26,840 --> 00:27:28,400
and demand justice.

433
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:30,800
But now I have no one to rely on.

434
00:27:32,280 --> 00:27:33,640
Except you, Mother,

435
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:37,720
there's no one else
in this world I can turn to…

436
00:27:42,120 --> 00:27:43,280
Don't be afraid.

437
00:27:46,680 --> 00:27:48,920
I'll always stand behind you.

438
00:27:51,160 --> 00:27:52,000
Don't worry.

439
00:28:04,840 --> 00:28:07,360
What about your legs?
Were your legs burned worse?

440
00:28:07,440 --> 00:28:08,280
Lift your robe. Let me see.

441
00:28:08,360 --> 00:28:10,760
I'm your own grandmother.
There's nothing to be shy about.

442
00:28:10,840 --> 00:28:13,840
They're really just burns.
They only look frightening.

443
00:28:14,560 --> 00:28:15,680
You…

444
00:28:16,800 --> 00:28:19,200
Mother. It's all that girl's fault.

445
00:28:19,280 --> 00:28:21,000
She's far too vicious.

446
00:28:23,120 --> 00:28:24,240
Sit.

447
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:27,040
Sit down.

448
00:28:27,560 --> 00:28:29,960
We're family. No need for formalities.

449
00:28:31,840 --> 00:28:34,680
We agreed before
that we'd only frighten her

450
00:28:34,760 --> 00:28:37,680
and make her leave the capital
with Huo Jue without a fuss.

451
00:28:37,760 --> 00:28:40,920
As long as she never came back,
and we appeased the Lu family,

452
00:28:41,000 --> 00:28:43,120
the matter would've ended peacefully.

453
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:46,880
Why make things more complicated
and let them spiral out of control?

454
00:28:59,840 --> 00:29:02,080
You… You lied to me?

455
00:29:02,880 --> 00:29:03,880
Don't tell me

456
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:09,320
you really planned
to lure that girl out of the capital

457
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:13,240
and secretly get rid of her?

458
00:29:13,800 --> 00:29:14,720
Mother.

459
00:29:15,680 --> 00:29:18,120
I've never killed the innocent.

460
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:19,280
That woman called A-Chou

461
00:29:20,120 --> 00:29:22,280
is a condemned prisoner.

462
00:29:22,360 --> 00:29:24,200
She's a murderer.

463
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:27,240
I'm only sending her where she belongs.

464
00:29:27,320 --> 00:29:28,400
What's wrong with that?

465
00:29:32,360 --> 00:29:33,400
Grandmother.

466
00:29:37,160 --> 00:29:40,440
Zhou… Zhou Fu. You've changed.

467
00:29:42,840 --> 00:29:45,840
You're still injured. Go get some rest.

468
00:29:55,280 --> 00:29:59,920
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

469
00:30:03,480 --> 00:30:05,080
Fu…

470
00:30:05,720 --> 00:30:09,040
You were once so proud and honorable.

471
00:30:10,120 --> 00:30:12,760
Cold on the outside, soft at heart.

472
00:30:12,840 --> 00:30:16,560
You couldn't even bear
to harm a blade of grass.

473
00:30:17,080 --> 00:30:18,680
But ever since you entered the palace,

474
00:30:19,560 --> 00:30:22,320
your face isn't the only thing
that's grown cold. Your heart has too.

475
00:30:23,040 --> 00:30:24,920
That's a human life.

476
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:27,840
How could you…just have her killed?

477
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:38,720
Mother, think about it.

478
00:30:39,240 --> 00:30:41,480
Think about where I went.

479
00:30:42,280 --> 00:30:43,840
I had to fight to survive.

480
00:30:45,720 --> 00:30:47,760
All the hardships I faced…

481
00:30:50,720 --> 00:30:53,120
The palace is strict,
with eyes everywhere.

482
00:30:54,040 --> 00:30:58,080
I used your illness as an excuse
just to spend a few days with you.

483
00:30:58,760 --> 00:31:01,000
You should understand
how hard things are for me.

484
00:31:03,800 --> 00:31:05,680
As for that woman called A-Chou,

485
00:31:06,360 --> 00:31:10,240
she may mean no harm,
but that doesn't mean she won't hurt us.

486
00:31:10,760 --> 00:31:12,920
As long as she's living as Wei Rao,

487
00:31:13,000 --> 00:31:15,800
she and Rao can never coexist.

488
00:31:17,160 --> 00:31:18,920
Would you really sacrifice
your own granddaughter

489
00:31:19,600 --> 00:31:21,920
for an outsider?

490
00:31:32,600 --> 00:31:35,960
Didn't you notice that girl

491
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:38,360
reminds me of someone?

492
00:31:39,000 --> 00:31:39,840
What are you saying?

493
00:31:42,320 --> 00:31:46,680
Back then,
someone knelt right here in this hall,

494
00:31:47,440 --> 00:31:49,000
just as defiant,

495
00:31:50,240 --> 00:31:52,160
questioning me again and again.

496
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:53,760
I still remember it

497
00:31:53,840 --> 00:31:56,920
as clearly as if it happened yesterday.

498
00:31:57,640 --> 00:32:00,400
How could you have forgotten?

499
00:32:01,840 --> 00:32:04,000
<i>I'm not saying you can't remarry.</i>

500
00:32:04,080 --> 00:32:06,440
The capital is full of talented men.

501
00:32:06,520 --> 00:32:10,040
You can choose any of them,

502
00:32:10,120 --> 00:32:11,480
and I'll give you my blessing.

503
00:32:11,560 --> 00:32:14,160
But you mustn't marry
into that gilded cage.

504
00:32:14,240 --> 00:32:15,720
Have you lost your senses?

505
00:32:15,800 --> 00:32:16,760
I want to be Empress!

506
00:32:17,880 --> 00:32:18,720
What did you say?

507
00:32:19,320 --> 00:32:22,360
They used to call
me a wet nurse's daughter,

508
00:32:22,440 --> 00:32:24,600
too lowborn to be Empress.

509
00:32:25,200 --> 00:32:28,440
Now they call me an unfaithful widow,

510
00:32:28,520 --> 00:32:30,480
too immoral to be Empress.

511
00:32:31,160 --> 00:32:32,840
My husband died,

512
00:32:32,920 --> 00:32:35,960
and they openly and secretly
bullied me and my fatherless child.

513
00:32:36,040 --> 00:32:38,360
They wanted me broken, crying every day.

514
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:40,640
They can dream!

515
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:43,280
The more they say I don't deserve it,

516
00:32:43,360 --> 00:32:44,640
the more I'm going to be Empress.

517
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:47,720
Just watch, Mother.
I'm going into the palace

518
00:32:47,800 --> 00:32:50,840
to carve out a place in this world
for myself and my daughter!

519
00:32:54,960 --> 00:32:56,080
Zhou Fu!

520
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:05,440
Mother, are you confused?

521
00:33:06,040 --> 00:33:08,080
How can you compare me to a murderer?

522
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:10,920
That's not what I meant. I just… I…

523
00:33:17,320 --> 00:33:18,280
Impossible.

524
00:33:19,120 --> 00:33:19,960
It can't be.

525
00:33:21,760 --> 00:33:23,680
Then just say I've lost my senses.

526
00:33:26,760 --> 00:33:28,560
Mother, don't be too softhearted.

527
00:33:29,280 --> 00:33:31,160
I brought her here today

528
00:33:31,680 --> 00:33:33,480
and you used
your authority to pressure her.

529
00:33:34,080 --> 00:33:36,760
But she wasn't the only one
I wanted to test.

530
00:33:37,400 --> 00:33:40,840
I also wanted
to test Lu Zhuo's intentions.

531
00:33:41,680 --> 00:33:43,560
If he'd agreed to my request,

532
00:33:43,640 --> 00:33:47,280
forgiven Rao, and taken her home at once,

533
00:33:47,360 --> 00:33:49,160
there'd still be room to fix this.

534
00:33:50,320 --> 00:33:51,680
But instead,

535
00:33:52,280 --> 00:33:53,960
his heart was hard as iron.

536
00:33:54,880 --> 00:33:56,760
So A-Chou absolutely

537
00:33:58,120 --> 00:33:59,720
cannot be allowed to live.

538
00:34:44,360 --> 00:34:45,960
My Lord, you saved my life.

539
00:34:46,840 --> 00:34:48,600
I don't know how I can ever repay you.

540
00:35:07,520 --> 00:35:09,400
Did you really need me to save you?

541
00:35:11,640 --> 00:35:13,160
Why would you say that, My Lord?

542
00:35:13,240 --> 00:35:15,080
I was trapped with no way out.

543
00:35:15,840 --> 00:35:18,000
If you hadn't arrived in time,

544
00:35:19,080 --> 00:35:22,720
I'd have been boiled alive
and reduced to a pile of flesh.

545
00:35:23,320 --> 00:35:25,160
You've shown me such great kindness.

546
00:35:26,680 --> 00:35:28,280
I'm deeply grateful.

547
00:35:29,560 --> 00:35:32,760
Even a lifetime of devotion
could never repay you.

548
00:35:37,880 --> 00:35:39,040
Liar.

549
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:42,840
His Majesty always rewards merit fairly.

550
00:35:44,040 --> 00:35:46,560
Worthy men from the countryside
can receive fine appointments.

551
00:35:47,560 --> 00:35:49,920
You tore up those contracts
on the city tower,

552
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:51,440
then won the people's hearts
by helping those in need.

553
00:35:52,320 --> 00:35:53,840
Everyone praises
your kindness and generosity.

554
00:35:53,920 --> 00:35:55,160
His Majesty

555
00:35:56,480 --> 00:35:57,840
would never leave such merit unrewarded.

556
00:35:59,480 --> 00:36:00,680
But that wasn't enough for you.

557
00:36:00,760 --> 00:36:03,920
You even brought Qi Zhongkai
and Han Liao as witnesses.

558
00:36:05,400 --> 00:36:06,520
What do you mean?

559
00:36:08,720 --> 00:36:10,120
You know exactly what I mean.

560
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:13,280
Qi Zhongkai is obvious enough.

561
00:36:14,520 --> 00:36:16,280
He loses his head whenever he sees you.

562
00:36:17,880 --> 00:36:20,520
Everyone knows the Empress Dowager
despises Lady Li.

563
00:36:20,600 --> 00:36:22,000
They've been enemies for years.

564
00:36:22,600 --> 00:36:25,600
And Han Liao is kin
to the Empress Dowager.

565
00:36:25,680 --> 00:36:26,840
He's been watching you closely.

566
00:36:28,400 --> 00:36:30,080
If you'd truly died at Xianzhuang,

567
00:36:30,600 --> 00:36:32,960
the Empress Dowager
could've used it against Lady Li.

568
00:36:33,040 --> 00:36:34,320
The entire Zhou family

569
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:36,440
would've been dragged into it.

570
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:39,960
Unless Lady Li is truly a fool,

571
00:36:40,680 --> 00:36:42,320
she'd never kill anyone at Xianzhuang.

572
00:36:43,320 --> 00:36:44,720
She was only trying to scare you.

573
00:36:47,840 --> 00:36:50,440
I truly pitied those refugees.

574
00:36:53,200 --> 00:36:56,000
But you, My Lord, suspect everything.

575
00:36:58,200 --> 00:37:00,480
So why did you still seek
an imperial decree?

576
00:37:03,320 --> 00:37:07,840
Why not let them take me,
sell me off somewhere far away,

577
00:37:08,600 --> 00:37:10,880
so I'd never trouble you again?

578
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:14,240
Wouldn't you have peace forever?

579
00:37:17,480 --> 00:37:19,040
I wasn't trying to help you.

580
00:37:20,280 --> 00:37:21,360
I just

581
00:37:23,560 --> 00:37:25,440
didn't want that vicious woman
into my house.

582
00:37:28,160 --> 00:37:29,760
Since you've taken her place,

583
00:37:30,720 --> 00:37:32,160
then hold on to it.

584
00:37:32,960 --> 00:37:34,360
If you dare give up halfway,

585
00:37:35,080 --> 00:37:36,360
I'll be the first to make you pay.

586
00:37:40,760 --> 00:37:42,040
No matter what,

587
00:37:44,200 --> 00:37:45,720
you saved me, My Lord.

588
00:37:46,680 --> 00:37:47,720
That makes you my benefactor.

589
00:37:49,080 --> 00:37:51,080
Whatever reward you want,

590
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:54,040
I won't refuse you anything.

591
00:38:04,040 --> 00:38:06,680
In the name of repayment,
you seek to mend old ties with me.

592
00:38:08,360 --> 00:38:09,400
And if you're lucky,

593
00:38:10,800 --> 00:38:12,800
you'd bear my child and secure your life.

594
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:16,120
Well, well, Wei Rao.

595
00:38:19,760 --> 00:38:21,600
Am I part of your next move too?

596
00:38:33,040 --> 00:38:34,160
Then you underestimate me.

597
00:38:36,480 --> 00:38:38,400
I don't want false affection.

598
00:38:52,760 --> 00:38:54,040
Forgive me for disturbing you.

599
00:38:55,520 --> 00:38:57,360
I've never met a woman like you.

600
00:38:58,120 --> 00:39:01,040
I can never tell when you're sincere
and when you're pretending.

601
00:39:02,040 --> 00:39:03,720
I can never read your heart.

602
00:39:04,840 --> 00:39:06,000
Let me remind you.

603
00:39:09,520 --> 00:39:12,240
Sweet talk and false affection

604
00:39:13,280 --> 00:39:15,200
will never win you a sincere heart.

605
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:19,560
Only those who live in comfort
and without fear can afford sincerity.

606
00:39:20,840 --> 00:39:23,200
All I learned growing up
was how to beg and survive.

607
00:39:24,200 --> 00:39:25,920
If you want my body,

608
00:39:26,000 --> 00:39:28,200
or a smile meant to please you,
I can give you both.

609
00:39:28,800 --> 00:39:31,520
But don't ask me
for something I can't give.

610
00:39:32,880 --> 00:39:34,320
A sincere heart is too precious.

611
00:39:35,800 --> 00:39:37,160
I don't have one to give.

612
00:40:02,480 --> 00:40:03,720
What are you doing?

613
00:40:08,480 --> 00:40:11,840
His Lordship ordered us
to redeem all the jewelry you pawned.

614
00:40:11,920 --> 00:40:14,000
He also said that now you're a Noble Lady,

615
00:40:14,080 --> 00:40:16,240
you shouldn't dress too plainly.

616
00:40:16,320 --> 00:40:19,360
He had the storeroom opened
so you can choose what you like tomorrow.

617
00:40:28,400 --> 00:40:31,560
<i>Lu Zhuo. Why are you so good to me?</i>

618
00:40:43,400 --> 00:40:45,920
Bitao, you're
Noble Lady Wu'an's favorite now.

619
00:40:46,520 --> 00:40:49,480
I suppose you've forgotten
how Madam once helped you.

620
00:40:50,200 --> 00:40:52,640
Her Ladyship will suspect something
if she wakes and I'm gone.

621
00:40:52,720 --> 00:40:54,600
I don't have time for your nonsense.

622
00:40:54,680 --> 00:40:57,040
Madam told me to remind you

623
00:40:57,120 --> 00:40:58,880
to watch that woman's every move.

624
00:40:58,960 --> 00:41:02,800
If she does anything unusual,
report it to Madam first.

625
00:41:03,440 --> 00:41:04,600
What exactly is Madam planning?

626
00:41:04,680 --> 00:41:06,560
That's none of your concern.

627
00:41:06,640 --> 00:41:08,680
Madam will give you orders
when the time comes.

628
00:41:08,760 --> 00:41:11,040
If you slack off even a little,

629
00:41:11,120 --> 00:41:13,120
your whole family
will pay with their lives.

630
00:41:20,760 --> 00:41:21,600
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

631
00:41:21,680 --> 00:41:23,240
My Lady.

632
00:41:23,320 --> 00:41:26,400
My Lady, please save us!

633
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:27,880
My Lady!

634
00:41:27,960 --> 00:41:29,720
Please save us!

635
00:41:30,480 --> 00:41:31,920
- Steward, go see what's happening.
- My Lady!

636
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:33,800
- What's going on?
- So many people kneeling outside.

637
00:41:33,880 --> 00:41:35,400
What's so alarming?

638
00:41:35,480 --> 00:41:37,320
- Let's go see.
- Please save us!

639
00:41:37,400 --> 00:41:38,960
Please save us!

640
00:41:39,040 --> 00:41:42,000
- My Lady!
- Go tell His Lordship. Hurry.

641
00:41:42,080 --> 00:41:43,760
Please save us!

642
00:41:45,280 --> 00:41:47,000
Please save us!

643
00:41:47,080 --> 00:41:48,120
‪My Lady!

644
00:41:48,200 --> 00:41:49,480
What's going on?

645
00:41:49,560 --> 00:41:50,920
- They're here to see Lady Lu,
- Please save us!

646
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:53,000
- No, to see Lady Wu'an.
- Please save us!

647
00:41:53,080 --> 00:41:54,680
- Me?
- Yes.

648
00:41:54,760 --> 00:41:56,560
Please save us!

649
00:41:56,640 --> 00:41:57,880
Please save us!

650
00:41:57,960 --> 00:41:59,200
My Lady!

651
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:01,720
- Sir, please get up.
- My Lady, please save us!

652
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:05,760
My Lady,
you kindly freed us from our contracts.

653
00:42:05,840 --> 00:42:07,520
Word has spread throughout the capital.

654
00:42:08,440 --> 00:42:11,760
At the foot of Mount Yaowang,
over 300 farming families,

655
00:42:11,840 --> 00:42:15,120
more than 2000 people,
have all benefited from your kindness.

656
00:42:15,760 --> 00:42:18,760
They all wish they could kneel here
and thank you.

657
00:42:18,840 --> 00:42:20,360
But none of them can write,

658
00:42:21,040 --> 00:42:23,320
so they put their handprints
on these bamboo slips.

659
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:25,520
Every last one of them.

660
00:42:25,600 --> 00:42:27,360
They asked us to bring this to you.

661
00:42:28,240 --> 00:42:31,480
Please accept it,
and take us under your protection.

662
00:42:32,960 --> 00:42:34,880
Yes, My Lady. Please take it.

663
00:42:34,960 --> 00:42:36,480
Please take it, My Lady.

664
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:38,480
Please take it.

665
00:42:38,560 --> 00:42:40,360
They've all come to seek
Noble Lady Wu'an's protection.

666
00:42:41,000 --> 00:42:42,760
Please, My Lady.

667
00:42:43,360 --> 00:42:46,160
Sir, I freed you
so you could live as free people.

668
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:49,320
I don't need tenant farmers,
much less servants.

669
00:42:49,400 --> 00:42:50,560
Please, everyone, go home.

670
00:42:50,640 --> 00:42:52,880
- My Lady, please don't abandon us!
- Please don't abandon us!

671
00:42:52,960 --> 00:42:56,000
- Please don't abandon us!
- Please!

672
00:42:56,080 --> 00:42:58,440
- Please get up. I can't accept this.
- I won't get up.

673
00:42:58,520 --> 00:42:59,840
Please get up.

674
00:42:59,920 --> 00:43:01,600
You freed them from the cruel Han family

675
00:43:01,680 --> 00:43:03,080
and made them free people.

676
00:43:03,600 --> 00:43:04,920
That was indeed an act of kindness.

677
00:43:05,760 --> 00:43:08,160
But the capital's nobles
and powerful families

678
00:43:08,720 --> 00:43:10,480
see people and land as prizes to seize.

679
00:43:11,440 --> 00:43:12,760
Why would they let them go so easily?

680
00:43:12,840 --> 00:43:14,800
Once they lose their protector,

681
00:43:15,440 --> 00:43:17,520
they'll end up as something
everyone fights over,

682
00:43:18,040 --> 00:43:19,240
and face an even worse fate.

683
00:43:19,320 --> 00:43:21,840
‪Is there really no other way,
‪Your Ladyship?

684
00:43:21,920 --> 00:43:22,880
Don't forget,

685
00:43:23,880 --> 00:43:25,320
Whenever a countryman rises in power,

686
00:43:25,920 --> 00:43:27,240
families of modest means

687
00:43:27,320 --> 00:43:28,720
hand over their land and homes,

688
00:43:28,800 --> 00:43:30,520
gladly becoming tenants and servants.

689
00:43:30,600 --> 00:43:33,240
All they want is to be safe.

690
00:43:34,040 --> 00:43:37,200
They all come to you
because they chose you

691
00:43:40,920 --> 00:43:42,640
to be their true protector.

692
00:43:43,720 --> 00:43:46,720
My Lady, please… Please take us in!

693
00:43:46,800 --> 00:43:47,880
‪Please take us in!

694
00:43:47,960 --> 00:43:49,680
- Please take us in!
- Please!

695
00:43:49,760 --> 00:43:51,600
- My Lady!
- Please take us in!

696
00:43:51,680 --> 00:43:53,320
‪Take us in!

697
00:43:53,400 --> 00:43:56,600
- Take us in!
- Please!

698
00:43:56,680 --> 00:43:59,200
Please take us in, My Lady.

699
00:43:59,280 --> 00:44:00,480
‪Take us in, My Lady.

700
00:44:00,560 --> 00:44:03,320
- Please don't abandon us.
- Please take us in!

701
00:44:03,400 --> 00:44:04,360
‪Don't abandon us.

702
00:44:04,440 --> 00:44:05,560
I can't help you.

703
00:44:07,120 --> 00:44:08,520
Find someone else.

704
00:44:08,600 --> 00:44:13,160
- My Lady!
- My Lady!

705
00:44:13,240 --> 00:44:15,120
- Please!
- Please save us!

706
00:44:15,200 --> 00:44:17,080
- Please!
- Look.

707
00:44:18,200 --> 00:44:19,800
Still just a sheltered woman.

708
00:44:19,880 --> 00:44:23,800
Even if I gave them to you for free,
would you dare take them?

709
00:44:23,880 --> 00:44:26,200
My Lady!

710
00:44:26,280 --> 00:44:28,280
Please save us!

711
00:44:28,360 --> 00:44:29,800
My Lady!

712
00:44:29,880 --> 00:44:31,760
Please take us in!

713
00:44:31,840 --> 00:44:33,840
- Please save us!
- My Lady!

714
00:44:33,920 --> 00:44:38,880
- We have nowhere else to turn!
- Please save us!

715
00:44:43,000 --> 00:44:46,000
Please have mercy, My Lady!

716
00:44:46,080 --> 00:44:49,040
Please save us!

717
00:44:52,600 --> 00:44:55,120
Please take us in!

718
00:44:57,320 --> 00:45:00,040
All right. You have my word.

719
00:45:02,760 --> 00:45:05,800
My Lady will be our protector from now on!

720
00:45:05,880 --> 00:45:07,440
My Lady is our protector!

721
00:45:07,520 --> 00:45:08,520
Please, get up.

722
00:45:09,320 --> 00:45:10,640
Thank you, My Lady!

723
00:45:16,480 --> 00:45:17,320
Let's go!

724
00:45:19,360 --> 00:45:20,840
My Lady is truly kind!

725
00:45:20,920 --> 00:45:23,520
We have someone to protect us now!

726
00:45:38,720 --> 00:45:40,360
Why did you suddenly change your mind?

727
00:45:45,280 --> 00:45:46,480
I refused

728
00:45:47,160 --> 00:45:48,720
because I can barely protect myself.

729
00:45:49,600 --> 00:45:51,160
I couldn't protect them.

730
00:45:53,920 --> 00:45:55,440
But then I realized something.

731
00:45:56,680 --> 00:45:57,720
We make our own fate.

732
00:45:58,360 --> 00:45:59,600
"We make our own fate"?

733
00:46:00,640 --> 00:46:01,880
What do you mean?

734
00:46:01,960 --> 00:46:03,880
I've seen it myself in the Lu family.

735
00:46:04,880 --> 00:46:07,360
Every great noble house
has its own retainers.

736
00:46:08,160 --> 00:46:11,880
So a Noble Lady appointed by the Emperor
can certainly have them too.

737
00:46:13,480 --> 00:46:14,320
What are you planning?

738
00:46:16,200 --> 00:46:18,360
I'll train the young
and able into my own guards

739
00:46:18,440 --> 00:46:19,280
to protect me.

740
00:46:20,920 --> 00:46:23,880
As long as I live another day,
I can protect them for another day.

741
00:46:24,840 --> 00:46:27,600
Every region needs officials to govern it.

742
00:46:28,280 --> 00:46:31,040
Rather than let corrupt officials
hold power and make the people suffer,

743
00:46:31,920 --> 00:46:33,400
I would rather take that position myself.

744
00:46:34,320 --> 00:46:35,360
I know I can do

745
00:46:36,880 --> 00:46:38,800
better than any of them.

746
00:46:40,480 --> 00:46:42,080
No one ever taught you this,

747
00:46:43,280 --> 00:46:44,720
yet you figured it out on your own.

748
00:46:47,520 --> 00:46:48,760
You truly are clever.

749
00:47:13,280 --> 00:47:14,120
Watch your step.

750
00:47:30,280 --> 00:47:32,280
My Lord, My Lady,
the Empress Dowager summons you.

751
00:47:48,920 --> 00:47:51,200
Wei Rao. Do you know your crime?

752
00:47:52,080 --> 00:47:54,240
<i>The Empress Dowager must have a reason</i>
<i>for summoning us privately.</i>

753
00:47:54,880 --> 00:47:56,080
I fear Han Liao

754
00:47:57,000 --> 00:47:58,440
has already accused you
before Her Majesty.

755
00:47:59,480 --> 00:48:01,840
You mean the Empress Dowager
knows who I really am?

756
00:48:03,760 --> 00:48:05,280
Will you confess or not?

757
00:48:07,640 --> 00:48:10,720
I confess my guilt. I deserve death!

758
00:48:10,800 --> 00:48:12,040
Good.

759
00:48:13,480 --> 00:48:15,560
Confess your crime honestly,

760
00:48:16,560 --> 00:48:17,680
and name the mastermind.

761
00:48:18,680 --> 00:48:21,680
I may show mercy and spare your life.

762
00:50:41,480 --> 00:50:44,480
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
